OL,3,GNEWSACar ban near schools 'would make a
OL,4,Abig difference'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA head teacher has said he would
OL,7,Fsupport his school joining a scheme
OL,8,Fdesigned to ban most cars from parking
OL,9,Faround it during peak times.
OL,11,FSteven Worthington, who runs the Dean
OL,12,FTrust Ardwick in east Manchester, said
OL,13,Fthere had been "a number of incidents"
OL,14,Fand "our young people are subjected to
OL,15,Fbad traffic pollution".
OL,17,FHe told the BBC that "traffic is very
OL,18,Fcongested during school drop-off and
OL,19,Fpick-up times... we're keen to address
OL,20,Fthis''.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
