OL,3,GNEWSACar ban near schools 'would make a
OL,4,Abig difference'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Manchester's School Streets
OL,7,Finitiative - which also encourages
OL,8,Fchildren to walk, cycle or scoot - was
OL,9,Flaunched five years ago and now covers
OL,10,F51 schools and more than 20,000 pupils.
